# The moves relative to the screen, LbaWinSettings: 242, 0x20 set
# (fixtures/screen: the CD's LBA.CFG with that key and the outside
# save). Each arrow, from no arrow, turns Twinsen at once the way it
# points: Up walks him up the screen, then Right and Left, and Up and
# Right together turn him on the way up and right, and Down turns him
# down. Sporty, Right runs him to the right.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 12
shot start
down Up
sleep 1.5
up Up
shot up
down Right
sleep 1.5
up Right
shot right
down Left
sleep 1
up Left
shot left
down Up Right
sleep 1.5
up Up Right
shot upright
sleep 1
down Down
sleep 1
up Down
shot down
key F2
sleep 1
down Right
sleep 1
up Right
shot run
sleep 1
shot end
